{"name":"Skydive","hex":"#60bfd3","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"skydive","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An instance of skydiving."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To be in freefall after jumping from an aircraft and landing safely by deploying a parachute."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/skydive"}],"entries":[{"title":"Parachuting","blocks":[{"text":"Parachuting is the descent of a person through the atmosphere using a parachute. In sport parachuting, a jumper normally exits an aircraft, passes through a period of free fall, deploys a steerable canopy, flies it to a landing area and lands. Skydiving is commonly used as a synonym for sport parachuting, although it can more narrowly refer to controlling the body during freefall before the canopy is deployed."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Parachute_Descent.jpg/330px-Parachute_Descent.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parachuting","wikidata":"Q193210"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/First_parachute.jpg/500px-First_parachute.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/First_parachute.jpg/1280px-First_parachute.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/First_parachute.jpg/500px-First_parachute.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A nineteenth-century illustration of Garnerin's 1797 parachute descent at Parc Monceau","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFirst_parachute.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Full_size_Ewan_Cowie_-_20250513_-_ECP01970_04.jpg/500px-Full_size_Ewan_Cowie_-_20250513_-_ECP01970_04.jpg?utm_source=en.wiki